  "details": "I put a mobile phone on my avatar and I want to grab the phone out of the pocket.\nThe VRC Contact do not provide a IsGrabbed parameter. So I need to put a bone with Phys Bone script on my phone just for an IsGrabbed parameter. VRC Contact script is supposed to send a collision signal. Implementing these parameters will be very beneficial to doing some interesting stuff.\nWe just need 4 bool built-in parameters:\nGrabbingLeft\nInteractingLeft\nGrabbingRight\nInteractingRight",
